    "comment": [
        "The design the simulator lays out and measures. Only the properties that differ from the catalogue's",
        "defaults are listed; tests/tools/designer-sim.js fills the rest in, so this stays readable.",
        "",
        "The geometry is chosen so that a mistake has somewhere to show: the band is flush to three edges, the",
        "title sits inside the band (the common 'label on a background' case, which means two widgets in",
        "overlapping cells), the button is at odd coordinates, the meter spans the full width, the two footer",
        "pieces share the vertical edge at x=240, and the spacer is a 3x3 flush against the right edge."
    ],
    "probe": {
        "comment": [
            "A spot to check paint rather than geometry. The button is probed because it is a widget whose",
            "background really is painted from its own property; the band cannot be, because the generator",
            "emits a theme-styled panel for a rect and ignores its fill. The point is left of centre so the",
            "button's centred text does not sit on it."
        ],
        "widget": "go",
        "x": 21,
        "y": 62
    },
